{"ref":"BDB, מַדָּע","hw":"מַדָּע","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַדָּע</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.12\">2 Ch 1:12</a></sup> <strong>knowledge, thought</strong> (late); <span dir=\"rtl\">מַדָּע</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.10\">2 Ch 1:10</a> + 4 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַדָּֽעֲךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:20\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.20\">Ec 10:20</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>knowledge</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָכְמָה</span>) of Solomon, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.10\">2 Ch 1:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.12\">12</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:4\" href=\"/Daniel.1.4\">Dn 1:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָכְמָה</span> and <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּעַת</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:7\" href=\"/Daniel.1.7\">7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשְׂכֵּל</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>place of knowledge, mind</em>, (in our idiom also) <em>thought</em> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:20\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.20\">Ec 10:20</a>.","next":"BDB, מַדּוּעַ","prev":"BDB, מֹדַ֫עַת"}